{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57580","headline":"函谷关元君铅汞謌 · 无名氏","name":"函谷关元君铅汞謌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红铅黑铅大丹头，红铅黑铅体同金。\n黑金取精赤取髓，解用赤黑药无比。\n用赤入黑保长生，用黑入赤天仙矣。\n颠倒两法緫称铅，黑能变化赤天仙。\n至道之人莫容易，贪财好色不须传。\n函谷关头梁石山，老君镌石留此言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}